# Pairs with OwnerMonotonic. Reproduces current production (#4455): the online
# snapshot copies committed entries only, so a batch prepared on the old copy
# before the snapshot has no bucket on the resized copy, and a commit decided
# before the flip reverts there.
MODULE: OwnerMonotonicRetainedSnapshotDropsBuckets
TARGET: OwnerMonotonic
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the snapshot copies committed entries only, so a commit decided before the flip reverts on the resized copy
PERTURBS: SnapCopy

--- FIND
    /\ pend' = [x \in Copies |-> [s \in Shards |-> [k \in Keys |->
                 IF x = R /\ s \in rzShards /\ pend[R][s][k] = "none"
                 THEN pend[T][s][k] ELSE pend[x][s][k]]]]
    /\ rz' = "copied"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: prepared buckets are not copied.
    /\ UNCHANGED pend
    /\ rz' = "copied"
--- END
